---
import RightSection from './RightSection.astro';
---

<RightSection>
  <div class='relative'>
    <h1 class='text-3xl font-bold'>More about me</h1>
    <p>I run my own Proxmox cluster at home, self-hosting services for fun, and to learn new things in my own lab.</p>
    <p>
      Creating useful things is what drives me. Whether it's a personal side project or my full-time job, I always try to
      make the best of it. Even the projects that failed taught me a lot.
    </p>
    <p>Music has been part of my life since I was a kid. Music theory is a fascinating field, and playing instruments is even better.</p>
    <p>I love bikes, boards, and anything that has wheels.</p>
    <p>Learning never stops being fun.</p>
  </div>
</RightSection>
